@startuml
title Embers crate dependency graph
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #294C60
  ArrowColor #294C60
}
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #F8FBFF
  BorderColor #6A92AA
}

package "embers workspace" {
  [embers\n(bin: embers, generate_schema)] as embers #FFC9A8
  [events-sync\n(bin)] as events #D0E0E3
  [state-sync\n(bin)] as state #D0E0E3
  [firefly-client\n(lib)] as fc #CDEACC
  [firefly-client-macros\n(proc-macro)] as macros #D5EAF7
}

[f1r3node-models\n(git @ c95595aa)] as models #FFE4A6
[oracle\n(detached, excluded)] as oracle #FFF9C4
[rholang-rs parser\n(local path)] as parser #E8DACB

embers  --> fc
events  --> fc
state   --> fc
fc      --> macros
fc      --> models
macros  ..> fc     : dev-only (tests)
oracle  ..> parser
oracle  ..> fc     : dev

note bottom of models #FFF0C7
Re-exported as firefly_client::models (casper / rhoapi /
servicemodelapi). Its build emits the tonic SERVER stubs
(build_server = true), enabling an in-process fake node.
end note
@enduml
